{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.charm",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "交流会结束以后",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.charm",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kiriko.charm",
    "idolId": "kiriko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "辛苦了，霧子。交流会气氛很好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "制作人先生……是的……谢谢您……！",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "非常……开心……感觉和大家的心意也通了……",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我也这么觉得。霧子成长了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（甚至有点寂寞。）",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "那个，我马上收拾，可以等我一下吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没关系，之后没有安排，慢慢来。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "让、让您久等了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……哈哈，不用那么急。那，我送你到车站——",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……霧子？手臂上的创可贴，快掉了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……哇哇！真的……！那、那个，这是……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么了？……疼吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "没、没什么……！……请别在意。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还是让我看看，我给你换一张。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不、不能看……！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？这不是伤，是字……？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "呜呜……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "咦？这是……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "是……制作人先生的名字……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……原、原来。为什么写在那种地方？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "嗯、嗯……算是一种护身符……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "我把制作人先生的名字写上，用创可贴护着……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "这样……就觉得制作人先生一直在身边……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "紧张、不安……就会咻地消失……大舞台上也能笑着站住……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "擅自写了……对不起……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（做这种像咒语一样的事……霧子也在拼命努力啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "霧子，完全不用道歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……真的吗……？不会觉得……不舒服吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "完全不会……为什么这么问？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不会……变得讨厌我吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，怎么会……如果能鼓励到霧子，我很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过……就算不做这种事，我也会一直在霧子身边的。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "制作人先生……！我……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "能被制作人先生找到……真的……太好了……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也是，能遇见霧子真好。霧子，以后也一起加油吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好的……！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
